      "description": "对话内可用的备忘录，严格打通 macOS 提醒事项：支持到期时间/优先级/备注/多列表，可创建、修改、完成、删除（双向同步）；右侧「备忘」面板一览与快捷录入。",
      "version": "0.3.0",
      "tier": "js",
      "minAppVersion": "1.0.5",
      "sdkVersion": "^0.4",
      "permissions": [
        "storage",
        "tools",
        "ui:settings-section",
        "ui:panel-tab",
        "exec:osascript"
      ],
      "files": {
        "manifest.json": "6174693f459e01b8526fd0b3e881c8fa0ccf273d32c20af9ab722ff7d497d281",
        "main.js": "1d57dcf3dce55e6dae3fccae50d99e489c6e72989efd95859697acf0ffa3eed9"
      },
      "notes": "v0.3.0：提醒事项深度打通（dueDate/优先级/备注/列表选择/update/delete+tombstone 防重建）+ 右侧面板；67 项单测与真机 osascript 全链路终验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lawyer-calendar",
